2. What we are building
Build a multi-tenant B2B AI voice-calling SaaS platform for Indian businesses.
Target customers include:
- Real estate businesses.
- Educational institutions.
- Local small and medium businesses.
A business will eventually be able to:
1. Sign in to its own organization account.
2. Add money to a prepaid INR wallet.
